<title>USA: Langer Biomechanics hires strategic advisor.</title>
<headline>Langer Biomechanics hires strategic advisor.</headline>
<dateline>DEER PARK, N.Y. 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Langer Biomechanics Group Inc said Wednesday it had hired Synergy Capital Inc to advise the company on strategies to increase shareholder value and position it for future growth.</p>
<p>Langer sells products to healthcare professionals for the treatment of foot-related problems.</p>
<p>The company reported a net profit of $0.02 per share in its fourth quarter ended February 28, compared with a net loss of $0.26 per share in the prior year period.</p>
